# Machine-local Conductor overrides. Left unignored they keep `git status
# --untracked-files=all` non-empty, which is what the lane validation preflight
# and the cloud takeover guard refuse to run against, and Conductor has
# reported them in failed `conductor/telegram-*` branch creation too.
.conductor/settings.local.toml
.conductor/settings.local.json
